  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Context Analysis and Advocacy Training- Sierra Leone and Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For the 2018/19 GPAT initiated a new strategy of GPAT is trialing a new system of having focus countries where there will be a sustained effort to help contribute to a significant step forward for the country programme in terms of its Governance and Advocacy work. Sierra Leone /Liberia programme is one of the countries of support. As part of the MOU, GPAT and SL agreed to conduct a context analysis for the programme to inform the programming options in Governance and advocacy through a support visit.</narrative>
  </description>
